urope/ecuador\" style=\"outline: 0px;cursor: pointer;\" target=\"_blank\">\n           CAFE IMPORT\n          </a>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlajZ0qxia4sy1AmyTOCTwWo9icdSZb4AR6NO727rjxvdCVMQicHCBKdOONg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlaO8st3wWJAg8NrbKv0ymTtX1xo0yeJBml4nzPibBlPff0RqafqOu42FQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n           关于\n          </span>\n<span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;outline: 0px;font-size: 13.3333px;\">\n           El Dorado\n           <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<hr style='white-space: normal;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);border-right-width: 0px;border-style: solid;border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);border-bottom-width: 0px;border-left-width: 0px;transform: scale(1, 0.5);transform-origin: 0px 0px 0px;'/>\n<p style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: PingFangSC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 1px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\n          El Dorado庄园坐落于厄瓜多尔的洛哈省，由Elder家族2017年购入，\n         </span>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: PingFangSC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 1px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\n          庄园总面积64公顷其中用于咖啡种植的有38公顷，目前主要种植红瑰夏（绿顶），黄瑰夏，SL28，Wushwush和Typica Mejorado，2023年开始种植Sidra；其中各个品种的种植情况如下，\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 10pt;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: PingFangSC-light;letter-spacing: 1px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\n          红瑰夏（绿顶），种植海拔1730 - 1830米，50000株，其中11800株是第三个产季，9500株第二个产季，8500株是第一个产季采收；\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: PingFangSC-light;letter-spacing: 1px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\n          Wushwush种植1700-1760米的海拔区域，11500株，4000株是第三个产季采收了；\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: PingFangSC-light;letter-spacing: 1px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\n          黄瑰夏种植海拔在1700-1750米区域，11000株，第三个产季采收；\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: PingFangSC-light;letter-spacing: 1px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\n          SL28 种植在1760-1830米的海拔区域，23000株，3000株是第三个产季，20000株是第一个产季采收；\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RfjKUa9OVEnaRkI2mOuSF0Fpmib3OoU7yXlI0M5MiapFNT4aw4Egwtm8G2SBYYNlcla3jViaiaicUTwZg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RfjKUa9OVEnaRkI2mOuSF0S3l4CCYOeyafRsAiahQ6fvfM1GuEE5Zq35Nuj48M0YFxE27vxKMvsLA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: PingFangSC-light;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 1px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;\">\n            El Dorado与我们曾经采购过的Noria和Eliza庄园都是由各自的庄园主与\n           </span>\n           Chocovilcamundo S.A.（CVM伯纳德家族的农业公司）集团合作，CVM公司由\n           <span style=\"outline: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;\">\n             Bernard Uhe和他的家族，来自于哥伦比亚Ibague的咖农家族所创立拥有；他们的合作模式是\n            </span>\n</span>\n           庄园提供种植的资源，CVM提供他们在哥伦多年的咖啡种植管理加工处理经验，双方为了生产高品质的咖啡目标努力；\n           <span style=\"outline: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;\">\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: PingFangSC-light;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 1px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: PingFangSC-light;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 1px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\n           El Dorado所获的奖项：\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: PingFangSC-light;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 1px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\n           2021 Taza Dorada #3 （厄瓜多尔金杯）\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: PingFangSC-light;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 1px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\n           2021 CoE #13\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: PingFangSC-light;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 1px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\n           2022 CoE #4\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: PingFangSC-light;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 1px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\n           2022 Taza Dorada #6（厄瓜多尔金杯）\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: PingFangSC-light;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 1px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\n           2023 CoE #8\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SHZLbYlQS1nLtCjecjqTelficyIbrMdZd1x8Yib67yeVGZuMDTKicJgqKickTfkIOcveVFnOj4MbRCGg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n<